@startuml forms-vol11-flow
title Sample flow - outbreak investigation (volume 11)
autonumber

participant "Clinician\n(vol 2)" as DR
participant "SES centre\n(vol 11)" as SES
participant "Microbiology\nlab (vol 11)" as LAB

DR -> SES : 058 rapid notification (vol 3)\n060 infectious-disease register, 264 emergency notification
SES -> SES : 262 epidemiological focus investigation card
SES -> LAB : samples from cases & environment
LAB -> SES : 350/365-378 microbiology results
alt confirmed focus
  SES -> SES : 258/259 patient transport/evacuation\n261 focus disinfection, 390 final disinfection order
end
alt sanitary violation found
  SES -> SES : 311 violation protocol, 312 penalty
end

note over SES, LAB
  The rapid-notification form (058) is filed under volume 3;
  the labs follow the analysis pattern of volume 3. The
  registers themselves are queries, not clinical documents.
end note
@enduml
